#: src/libvlc-module.c:139
msgid "Enable bit-exact mode (pure mode)"
msgstr "Cuir am modh bit-pongail an comas (modh fìor-ghlan)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:141
msgid ""
"This will disable all audio filters, even audio converters. This may result "
"on audio not working if the output can't adapt to the input format."
msgstr ""
"Cuiridh seo gach criathrag fuaime à comas, fiù 's na h-iompachairean fuaime. "
"Dh'fhaoidte nach obraich an fhuaim mur urrainn dhan às-chur gabhail ri "
"fòrmat an ion-chuir."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:275
msgid ""
"This is the video output method used by VLC. The default behavior is to "
"automatically select the best method available."
msgstr ""
"Seo an dòigh a chleachdas VLC a chum às-chur video. Thèid an dòigh as fhearr "
"a thaghadh a ghnàth."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:285
msgid ""
"This requests a specific pixel width for the video window. By default (-1), "
"the width is requested according to the zoom setting."
msgstr ""
"Iarraidh seo leud sònraichte ann am piogsailean airson uinneag a' video. A "
"ghnàth (-1), thèid an leud iarraidh a-rèir roghainn an t-sùmaidh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:290
msgid ""
"This requests a specific pixel height for the video window. By default (-1), "
"the height is requested according to the zoom setting."
msgstr ""
"Iarraidh seo àirde shònraichte ann am piogsailean airson uinneag a' video. A "
"ghnàth (-1), thèid an àirde iarraidh a-rèir roghainn an t-sùmaidh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:340
msgid "360 videos projection mode"
msgstr "Modh teilgidh nam videothan 360"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:342
msgid "Change the 360 video projection mode."
msgstr "Atharraich modh teilgidh nam videothan 360."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:391
msgid "Deinterlace filter"
msgstr "Criathrag deinterlace"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:392
msgid "Deinterlace module to use."
msgstr "Am mòideal deinterlace a thèid a chleachdadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:394
msgid "Video Stereo 3D mode"
msgstr "Modh stereo 3D a' video"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:395
msgid "Set the Video Stereo 3D mode."
msgstr "Suidhich modh stereo 3D a' video."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:403 src/video_output/vout_intf.c:168
msgid "Left Only"
msgstr "Clì a-mhàin"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:403 src/video_output/vout_intf.c:169
msgid "Right Only"
msgstr "Deas a-mhàin"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:404 src/video_output/vout_intf.c:170
msgid "Side-by-Side"
msgstr "Taobh ri taobh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:432
msgid "When fullscreen"
msgstr "Ann an làn-sgrìn"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:495
msgid "Video fitting"
msgstr "Freagarrachadh a' video"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:497
msgid "This selects the dimension according to which the video will be scaled."
msgstr "Taghaidh seo an tomhas a-rèir an tèid a' video a sgèileadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:543
msgid "Mouse Pause Policy"
msgstr "Poileasaidh stad na luchaige"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:545
msgid "This controls how pause on mouse click is handled"
msgstr "Stiùiridh seo mar a thèid stad le briogadh na luchaige a làimhseachadh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:552 modules/access/rist.h:85
#: modules/audio_output/mmdevice.c:1621
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:181
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1224
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:342
#: modules/gui/qt/player/qml/AudioVisualizationDialog.qml:23
#: modules/gui/qt/player/qml/AudioVisualizationDialog.qml:144
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "À comas"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:552
msgid "Toggle pause immediately on mouse released"
msgstr "Toglaich an stad sa bhad nuair a leigear às putan na luchaige"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:596
msgid "Clock master source"
msgstr "Prìomh thùs an uaireadair"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:597
msgid ""
"Select the clock master source:\n"
"auto: best clock source, input if the access can't be paced (when playing "
"live content), or audio otherwise (most likely).\n"
"input: all tracks are driven by the input clock, via PCR updates from the "
"demuxer. This restore the VLC 3.0 clock behavior where both audio and video "
"tracks can be altered to catch up with the input.\n"
"audio: if an audio track is playing, the audio output will drive the clock "
"(Fallback to Monotonic if there is no audio tracks).\n"
"monotonic: all tracks are driven by the monotonic clock of the system."
msgstr ""
"Tagh prìomh thùs an uaireadair:\n"
"Fèin-obrachail: an tùs uaireadair as fheàrr; an t-ion-chur mur gabh astar an "
"inntrigidh a riaghladh (nuair a bhios susbaint bheò a' cluich), air neo an "
"fhuaim (mar as trice).\n"
"Ion-chur: thèid gach traca a stiùireadh le uaireadair an ion-chuir, le "
"ùrachaidhean PCR on demuxer. Bheir seo air ais giùlan uaireadair VLC 3.0, "
"far an gabh tracaichean fuaime is video atharrachadh gus breith air an ion-"
"chur.\n"
"Fuaim: ma tha traca fuaime a' cluich, stiùiridh às-chur na fuaime an t-"
"uaireadair (cleachdar an t-uaireadair monotonach mur eil traca fuaime ann).\n"
"Monotonach: thèid gach traca a stiùireadh le uaireadair monotonach an t-"
"siostaim."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:612
msgid "Input (PCR)"
msgstr "Ion-chur (PCR)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:614
msgid "Monotonic"
msgstr "Monotonach"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:657
#: modules/gui/qt/medialibrary/qml/VideoInfoExpandPanel.qml:295
msgid "Video track"
msgstr "Traca video"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:659
msgid "Stream number of the video track to use (from 0 to n)."
msgstr ""
"Àireamh an t-srutha aig traca a' video a thèid a chleachdadh (o 0 gu n)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:674
msgid ""
"Language of the audio track you want to use (comma separated, two or three "
"letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'none' to avoid a fallback to "
"another language)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan an traca fuaime a tha thu airson cleachdadh (air a sgaradh le "
"cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn dhut "
"'none' a chleachdadh gus nach tèid cànan eile a chleachdadh 'na àite)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:679
msgid ""
"Language of the subtitle track you want to use (comma separated, two or "
"three letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan traca nam fo-thiotalan a tha thu airson cleachdadh (air a sgaradh le "
"cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn dhut 'any' "
"a chleachdadh mar roghainn-èiginn)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:684
msgid ""
"Language of the menus you want to use with DVD/BluRay (comma separated, two "
"or three letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan nan clàr-taice a tha thu airson cleachdadh le DVD/BluRay (air a "
"sgaradh le cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn "
"dhut 'any' a chleachdadh mar roghainn-èiginn)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:687
msgid "Video track ID"
msgstr "ID traca a' video"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:689
msgid "Stream ID of the video track to use."
msgstr "ID an t-srutha aig traca a' video a chleachdar."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:717
msgid "Low delay mode"
msgstr "Modh dàil ìosal"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:719
msgid ""
"Try to minimize delay along decoding chain. Might break with non compliant "
"streams."
msgstr ""
"Feuchaidh seo ris an dàil a lùghdachadh air feadh slabhraidh an dì-"
"chòdachaidh. Dh'fhaoidte gum bris e le sruthan nach gèill ris na "
"riaghailtean."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:766
msgid "Should the playback resume where it was left off?"
msgstr "An lean a' chluich air adhart far an do sguir i?"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:775
msgid "Never resume playback where it was left off"
msgstr "Na lean air a' chluich far an do sguir i idir"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:776
msgid "Ask when the playback starts"
msgstr "Faighnich nuair a thòisicheas a' chluich"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:777
msgid "Always resume playback where it was left off"
msgstr "Lean air a' chluich far an do sguir i an-còmhnaidh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:780
msgid "Resume last playback states"
msgstr "Aisig na staidean cluiche mu dheireadh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:781
msgid ""
"This will resume the last playback state, such as the selected tracks, rate, "
"aspect-ratio, ..."
msgstr ""
"Aisigidh seo staid na cluiche mu dheireadh, can na tracaichean a chaidh a "
"thaghadh, an reat, co-mheas an deilbh, ..."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:821
msgid "Subtitle position"
msgstr "Ionad nam fo-thiotalan"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:823
msgid ""
"How high the subtitles are, in percent of the height of the picture above "
"their usual place (below it when negative). The same on any screen and in "
"any window size."
msgstr ""
"Dè cho àrd 's a bhios na fo-thiotalan, mar cheudad de dh'àirde an deilbh os "
"cionn an àite àbhaisteach aca (fodha ma tha e àicheil). Bidh e co-ionann air "
"sgrìn sam bith 's aig meud uinneige sam bith."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:834
msgid "Display sub-pictures on full window"
msgstr "Seall na fo-dhealbhan air an uinneag shlàn"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:836
msgid "It allows showing subtitles in black bars."
msgstr "Leigidh seo leat fo-thiotalan a shealltainn sna bàraichean dubha."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:838
msgid "Position of secondary subtitles"
msgstr "Ionad nam fo-thiotalan dàrnach"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:840
msgid ""
"Place on video where to display secondary subtitles (default bottom center)."
msgstr ""
"Far an tèid na fo-thiotalan dàrnach a shealltainn air a' video (a ghnàth sa "
"mheadhan aig a' bhonn)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:842
msgid "Force secondary subtitle position"
msgstr "Èignich ionad nam fo-thiotalan dàrnach"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:844
msgid ""
"You can use this option to vertically adjust the position secondary "
"subtitles are displayed."
msgstr ""
"'S urrainn dhut an roghainn seo a chleachdadh gus ionad inghearach nam fo-"
"thiotalan dàrnach a ghleusadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:847
msgid "On Screen Display duration"
msgstr "Faid an taisbeanaidh air an sgrìn"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:849
msgid "How long the messages of the On Screen Display stay, in milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Dè cho fad 's a dh'fhanas teachdaireachdan an taisbeanaidh air an sgrìn, ann "
"am mille-dhiogan."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:889
msgid "Subtitle Frames per Second"
msgstr "Frèamaichean gach diog nam fo-thiotalan"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:891
msgid "Override the normal frames per second settings. "
msgstr "Tar-àithn roghainnean àbhaisteach nam frèamaichean gach diog. "

#: src/libvlc-module.c:976
msgid ""
"This X.509 certificate file (PEM format) is used for server-side TLS. On OS "
"X, the string is used as a label to search the certificate in the keychain."
msgstr ""
"Thèid am faidhle teisteanais X.509 seo (fòrmat PEM) a chleachdadh airson TLS "
"taobh an fhrithealaiche. Air OS X, thèid an sreang a chleachdadh mar leubail "
"gus an teisteanas a lorg san t-slabhraidh-iuchrach."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1027
msgid ""
"These options allow you to control the preferred modules used for accessing, "
"demuxing and decoding (or encoding) inputs."
msgstr ""
"Leigidh na roghainnean seo leat na mòidealan as fheàrr leat a thaghadh "
"airson inntrigeadh, demuxadh agus dì-chòdachadh (no còdachadh) an ion-chuir."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1037
msgid "Enable hardware decoders"
msgstr "Cuir dì-chòdaichearan bathar-cruaidh an comas"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1039
msgid ""
"VLC will fallback automatically to software decoders in case of hardware "
"decoder failure."
msgstr ""
"Tillidh VLC gu dì-chòdaichearan bathar-bog gu fèin-obrachail ma "
"dh'fhàilligeas an dì-chòdaichear bathar-cruaidh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1042
msgid "Preferred decoder hardware device"
msgstr "An t-uidheam bathair-chruaidh dì-chòdachaidh as fheàrr leat"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1085
msgid ""
"This allows you to keep an unique stream output instance across multiple "
"play queue items."
msgstr ""
"Leigidh seo leat aon ionstans de às-chur an t-srutha a chumail thar iomadh "
"nì sa chiutha-cluich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1128
msgid "Tracer module"
msgstr "Mòideal an lorgaire"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1130
msgid "This allow to select which tracer module you want to use."
msgstr ""
"Leigidh seo leat am mòideal lorgaire a tha thu airson cleachdadh a thaghadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1149
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:23
msgid "Additional command line options"
msgstr "Roghainnean loidhne-àithne a bharrachd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1151
msgid ""
"Options VLC reads at every start, as if they were written on its command "
"line (the command line wins when it gives the same option). Write them as on "
"a command line, for example: --no-osd --network-caching=3000; quote a value "
"with spaces. Files to open, and the options only a command line can give (--"
"help, --config, --reset-config...), are left out."
msgstr ""
"Roghainnean a leughas VLC aig gach tòiseachadh mar gun robh iad sgrìobhte "
"air an loidhne-àithne aige (buannaichidh an loidhne-àithne ma bheir i an aon "
"roghainn). Sgrìobh iad mar a bhiodh iad air loidhne-àithne, mar eisimpleir: "
"--no-osd --network-caching=3000; cuir luach le beàrnan eadar comharran-"
"labhairt. Thèid faidhlichean ri am fosgladh agus na roghainnean nach gabh a "
"thoirt seachad ach air loidhne-àithne (--help, --config, --reset-config...) "
"fhàgail às."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1162
msgid "Statistics collection frequency"
msgstr "Tricead cruinneachadh na stadastaireachd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1164
msgid "Collection frequency of the statistics in ms."
msgstr "Tricead cruinneachadh na stadastaireachd ann am ms."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1208
msgid "Enqueue items into play queue in one instance mode"
msgstr "Cuir nithean sa chiutha-cluich sa mhodh aon ionstans"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1210
msgid ""
"When using the one instance only option, enqueue items to play queue and "
"keep playing current item."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chleachdas tu an roghainn aon ionstans a-mhàin, cuir nithean sa "
"chiutha-cluich agus lean air cluich an nì làithrich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1223
msgid ""
"These options define the behavior of the play queue. Some of them can be "
"overridden in the play queue dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Mìnichidh na roghainnean seo giùlan a' chiutha-cluich. Gabhaidh cuid dhiubh "
"tar-àithneadh ann an còmhradh a' chiutha-cluich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1228
msgid ""
"Automatically preparse items added to the play queue (to retrieve some "
"metadata)."
msgstr ""
"Ro-pharsaich na nithean a thèid a chur ris a' chiutha-cluich gu fèin-"
"obrachail (gus metadata fhaighinn)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1235
msgid "Preparsing threads"
msgstr "Snàithleanan ro-pharsachaidh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1237
msgid "Maximum number of threads used to preparse items"
msgstr ""
"An àireamh as motha de shnàithleanan a thèid a chleachdadh gus nithean a ro-"
"pharsachadh"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1239
msgid "Fetch-art threads"
msgstr "Snàithleanan faighinn obair-ealain"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1241
msgid "Maximum number of threads used to fetch art"
msgstr ""
"An àireamh as motha de shnàithleanan a thèid a chleachdadh gus obair-ealain "
"fhaighinn"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1252
msgid ""
"Select whether subdirectories must be expanded.\n"
"none: subdirectories do not appear in the play queue.\n"
"collapse: subdirectories appear but are expanded on first play.\n"
"expand: all subdirectories are expanded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tagh am feum na fo-phasgain a bhith air an leudachadh.\n"
"none: cha nochd na fo-phasgain sa chiutha-cluich.\n"
"collapse: nochdaidh na fo-phasgain ach thèid an leudachadh a' chiad turas a "
"thèid an cluich.\n"
"expand: thèid gach fo-phasgan a leudachadh.\n"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1259
msgid ""
"Files with these extensions will not be added to play queue when opening a "
"directory.\n"
"This is useful if you add directories that contain playlist files for "
"instance. Use a comma-separated list of extensions."
msgstr ""
"Cha tèid faidhlichean leis na leudachain seo a chur ris a' chiutha-cluich "
"nuair a dh'fhosglas tu pasgan.\n"
"Tha seo feumail, mar eisimpleir, ma chuireas tu ris pasganan sa bheil "
"faidhlichean liosta-chluich. Cleachd liosta de leudachain air a sgaradh le "
"cromagan."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1268
msgid "Flatten files listed by extractors (archive)"
msgstr ""
"Rèidhich na faidhlichean a liostaicheas na h-às-tharraingichean (tasglann)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1277
msgid "VLC will randomly play files in the play queue until interrupted."
msgstr ""
"Cluichidh VLC faidhlichean sa chiutha-cluich air thuaiream gus an cuirear "
"stad air."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1281
msgid "VLC will keep playing the play queue indefinitely."
msgstr "Cumaidh VLC a' cluich a' chiutha-cluich gun sgur."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1285
msgid "VLC will keep playing the current play queue item."
msgstr "Cumaidh VLC a' cluich an nì làithrich sa chiutha-cluich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1289
msgid "Stop playback after each item in the play queue."
msgstr "Cuir stad air a' chluich an dèidh gach nì sa chiutha-cluich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1293
msgid "Exit if there are no more items in the play queue."
msgstr "Fàg mur eil nì sam bith eile sa chiutha-cluich."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1297
msgid "Pause each item in the play queue on the last frame."
msgstr "Cuir gach nì sa chiutha-cluich 'na stad air an fhrèam mu dheireadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1301
msgid "Pause each item in the play queue on the first frame."
msgstr "Cuir gach nì sa chiutha-cluich 'na stad air a' chiad fhrèam."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1304
msgid "Automatically start playing the play queue content once it's loaded."
msgstr ""
"Tòisich air susbaint a' chiutha-cluich a chluich gu fèin-obrachail nuair a "
"bhios i air a luchdadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1317
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:321
msgid "Use the media library"
msgstr "Cleachd leabhar-lann nam meadhanan"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1319
msgid ""
"Start the media library when VLC asks for it (the media player does). Turn "
"it off to browse without indexing your media; this takes effect the next "
"time VLC starts."
msgstr ""
"Tòisich leabhar-lann nam meadhanan nuair a dh'iarras VLC i (mar a nì an "
"cluicheadair mheadhanan). Cuir dheth i gus brabhsadh gun na meadhanan agad "
"inneacsadh; bidh buaidh aig seo an ath-thuras a thòisicheas VLC."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1323
msgid "Display play queue tree"
msgstr "Seall craobh a' chiutha-cluich"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1325
msgid ""
"The play queue can use a tree to categorize some items, like the contents of "
"a directory."
msgstr ""
"'S urrainn dhan chiutha-cluich craobh a chleachdadh gus cuid a nithean a "
"sheòrsachadh, can susbaint pasgain."

