msgid ""
"Select which preferences view to show upon opening the preferences dialog."
msgstr ""
"Tagh dè an sealladh roghainnean a thèid a shealltainn nuair a dh'fhosglas tu "
"còmhradh nan roghainnean."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:200
msgid ""
"Show a notification popup with the artist and track name when the current "
"play queue item changes, when VLC is minimized or hidden."
msgstr ""
"Seall priob-uinneag brath le ainm an neach-ealain is an traca nuair a "
"dh'atharraicheas an nì làithreach sa chiutha-cluich, nuair a bhios VLC fìor-"
"lùghdaichte no falaichte."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Sets the windows opacity between 0.1 and 1 for main interface, play queue "
"and extended panel. This option only works with Windows and X11 with "
"composite extensions."
msgstr ""
"Suidhichidh seo trìd-dhoilleireachd nan uinneagan eadar 0.1 is 1 airson na "
"prìomh eadar-aghaidh, a' chiutha-cluich is a' phanail leudaichte. Chan "
"obraich an roghainn seo ach air Windows agus X11 le leudachain composite."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:210
msgid ""
"Sets the fullscreen controller opacity between 0.1 and 1 for main interface, "
"play queue and extended panel. This option only works with Windows and X11 "
"with composite extensions."
msgstr ""
"Suidhichidh seo trìd-dhoilleireachd uidheam-smachd na làn-sgrìn eadar 0.1 is "
"1 airson na prìomh eadar-aghaidh, a' chiutha-cluich is a' phanail "
"leudaichte. Chan obraich an roghainn seo ach air Windows agus X11 le "
"leudachain composite."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:215
msgid "Initial user scale factor for the interface, between 0.3 and 3.0"
msgstr ""
"Factar sgèileadh tòiseachaidh a' chleachdaiche airson na h-eadar-aghaidh, "
"eadar 0.3 is 3.0"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:218
msgid ""
"Show the errors of VLC at the bottom of the window, and ask before removing "
"media from a playlist or from the play queue, or deleting playlists. Off, "
"the errors are only kept in the messages of VLC and these removals are done "
"at once; deleting a file from the disk is always confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Seall mearachdan VLC aig bonn na h-uinneige agus faighnich mus dèid "
"meadhanan a thoirt air falbh à liosta-chluich no on chiutha-cluich no mus "
"dèid liostaichean-cluiche a sguabadh às. Ma tha seo dheth, cha chumar na "
"mearachdan ach ann an teachdaireachdan VLC agus thèid na nithean a thoirt "
"air falbh sa bhad; thèid faighneachd an-còmhnaidh mus dèid faidhle a "
"sguabadh às on diosg."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:228
msgid "set the options for qml debugger"
msgstr "suidhich na roghainnean airson dì-bhugaire qml"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:229
msgid ""
"set the options for qml debugger (see http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquick-"
"debugging.html#starting-applications)"
msgstr ""
"suidhich na roghainnean airson dì-bhugaire qml (faic http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qtquick-debugging.html#starting-applications)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:249
msgid ""
"Show the playback controls in fullscreen when the mouse moves. Off, only the "
"keyboard shows them (the I key). The skins read it for their fullscreen "
"controller too."
msgstr ""
"Seall uidheaman-smachd na cluiche san làn-sgrìn nuair a ghluaiseas an "
"luchag. Ma tha seo dheth, cha nochd iad ach leis a' mheur-chlàr (an iuchair "
"I). Leughaidh na craicnean seo airson uidheam-smachd na làn-sgrìn aca "
"cuideachd."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:265
msgid ""
"Display the cover art of the audio playing in the player (the cone in the "
"compact view). Off, a plain picture takes its place, which also prevents "
"burning the screen."
msgstr ""
"Seall obair-ealain còmhdachaidh na fuaime a tha 'ga cluich sa chluicheadair "
"(an còn san t-sealladh dhùmhail). Ma tha seo dheth, thèid dealbh lom a chur "
"'na àite agus cuiridh sin bacadh air losgadh na sgrìn cuideachd."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:289
msgid ""
"This option allows the interface to be shown and raised automatically when a "
"video/audio playback starts, or never."
msgstr ""
"Leigidh an roghainn seo leis an eadar-aghaidh nochdadh is a thogail gu fèin-"
"obrachail nuair a thòisicheas cluich video/fuaime, no gun sin a dhèanamh "
"idir."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:292
msgid "Enable window titlebar"
msgstr "Cuir bàr tiotail na h-uinneige an comas"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:293
msgid ""
"This option enables the title bar. Disabling it will remove the titlebar and "
"move window buttons within the interface (Client Side Decoration)"
msgstr ""
"Cuiridh an roghainn seo am bàr tiotail an comas. Ma chuireas tu à comas e, "
"thèid am bàr tiotail a thoirt air falbh agus putanan na h-uinneige a "
"ghluasad dhan eadar-aghaidh (Client Side Decoration)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:297
msgid "Show the menu bar"
msgstr "Seall bàr a' chlàir-thaice"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:298
msgid "This option displays the classic menu bar"
msgstr "Seallaidh an roghainn seo bàr clasaigeach a' chlàir-thaice"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:300
msgid "Pin video controls"
msgstr "Prìnich uidheaman-smachd a' video"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:301
msgid "Place video controls above and below the video instead of above"
msgstr "Cuir uidheaman-smachd a' video os cionn is fon video seach air a mhuin"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:304
msgid "Show the frame at the hovered position above the seek bar"
msgstr ""
"Seall am frèam aig an ionad far a bheil an luchag os cionn bàr an t-sireadh"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:306
msgid ""
"Mark on the seek bar where the lines of the subtitle shown are, when it "
"comes from a subtitle file"
msgstr ""
"Cuir comharra air bàr an t-sireadh far a bheil loidhnichean an fho-thiotail "
"a chithear, nuair a thig e à faidhle fo-thiotalan"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:311
msgid "Select Qt video integration backend"
msgstr "Tagh backend aonachadh video Qt"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Select Qt video integration backend. Use with care, the interface may not "
"start if an incompatible compositor is selected"
msgstr ""
"Tagh backend aonachadh video Qt. Cleachd e gu faiceallach, dh'fhaoidte nach "
"tòisich an eadar-aghaidh ma thaghas tu compositor nach eil co-chòrdail"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:314
msgid "Use smooth scrolling in Flickable based views"
msgstr "Cleachd sgroladh rèidh ann an seallaidhean stèidhichte air Flickable"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:315
msgid ""
"Deactivating this option will disable smooth scrolling in Flickable based "
"views (such as the Play Queue). This option is only respected with a scroll "
"handler, see option `qt-use-scroll-handler`."
msgstr ""
"Ma chuireas tu an roghainn seo à gnìomh, thèid sgroladh rèidh a chur à comas "
"ann an seallaidhean stèidhichte air Flickable (can an ciutha-cluich). Cha "
"tèid an roghainn seo a chur an sàs ach le làimhsichear sgrolaidh, faic an "
"roghainn `qt-use-scroll-handler`."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:318
msgid "Use Kirigami scroll handler for Flickable based views"
msgstr ""
"Cleachd làimhsichear sgrolaidh Kirigami airson seallaidhean stèidhichte air "
"Flickable"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:319
msgid "Using Kirigami scroll handler may improve scrolling behavior."
msgstr ""
"Dh'fhaoidte gun dèan làimhsichear sgrolaidh Kirigami piseach air giùlan na "
"sgrolaidh."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:321
msgid "Safe area for the user interface"
msgstr "Raon sàbhailte airson na h-eadar-aghaidh"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:322
msgid ""
"Sets the safe area percentage between 0.0 and 100 when you want to ensure "
"the visibility of the user interface on a constrained viewport"
msgstr ""
"Suidhichidh seo ceudad an raoin shàbhailte eadar 0.0 is 100 nuair a tha thu "
"airson dèanamh cinnteach gum faicear an eadar-aghaidh air port-seallaidh "
"cuingichte"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:326
msgid "Print Qt's important internal messages"
msgstr "Seall teachdaireachdan inntearnail cudromach Qt"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:327
msgid "Enable Qt's all own messaging categories except the debug category."
msgstr ""
"Cuir an comas a h-uile roinn-seòrsa teachdaireachd aig Qt ach an roinn-"
"seòrsa dì-bhugachaidh."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:329
msgid "Hide the window on close"
msgstr "Falaich an uinneag nuair a thèid a dùnadh"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:330
msgid ""
"Instead of closing the application, hide the window. This setting is only "
"applicable when system tray icon is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Falaich an uinneag seach an aplacaid a dhùnadh. Chan obraich an roghainn seo "
"ach ma tha ìomhaigheag ann an treighe an t-siostaim an comas."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:332
msgid "Enable backdrop blur filter for the main window if possible"
msgstr ""
"Cuir criathrag sgleòthaidh a' chùlaibh an comas airson na prìomh-uinneige ma "
"ghabhas sin dèanamh"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:333
msgid ""
"If backdrop blur filter is available, use translucency in the backgrounds of "
"certain parts of the user interface instead of a solid color. This setting "
"impairs readibility of text."
msgstr ""
"Ma tha criathrag sgleòthaidh a' chùlaibh ri fhaighinn, cleachd trìd-"
"shoillseachd ann an cùlaibh cuid a phàirtean dhen eadar-aghaidh seach dath "
"soladach. Nì an roghainn seo cron air so-leughachd an teacsa."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:336
msgid "Enable picture-in-picture (PiP) mode"
msgstr "Cuir an comas am modh dealbh am broinn deilbh (PiP)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:337
msgid ""
