"RGB component to extract, as an RGB hexadecimal mask. E.g. 0xFF0000 for red; "
"0x00FF00 for green and 0x0000FF for blue."
msgstr ""
"An co-phàirt RGB a thèid às-tharraing, mar masg RGB sia-dheicheach. M.e. "
"0xFF0000 airson dearg; 0x00FF00 airson uaine agus 0x0000FF airson gorm."

#: modules/video_filter/gradient.c:64
